WEBVTT

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.460
What a lovely morning.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:53.970
Is this to your liking?

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.890
Oh, it's perfect!

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:58.680
You seem to have slept well.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.810
Why, of course! I've been
on the run for a few days now.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.270
I've grown quite accustomed
to camping out.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:10.860
I would hesitate to use the word
"camping" to describe this.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.320
What a handy little satchel.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.950
Changing the subject...

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:18.700
What has Letty all worked up this morning?

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:21.080
An upset stomach, perhaps?

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.120
Oh, I know!

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.910
You have to lay eggs every morning!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.290
Use the Lamaze method!
Breathe in, breathe out!

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.580
I'm a male!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:32.170
I asked him to decide which property
he'd like to tour next.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.010
And he's having trouble deciding?

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:35.590
Yeah...

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:40.140
I let Dearia handle everything till now...

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.350
Maybe I'll just let luck decide.

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.980
Come on, you drummox!

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:45.940
You're Piyovelt's father, are you not?!

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:50.020
And you can't even pick out a home?!
You need to be a better role model for him!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.530
Or at the very least, be a better dragon!

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:54.280
She speaks the truth!

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.320
Huh?

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.710
Pleased to make your
acquaintance, Red Dragon.

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:07.920
I'm with the Non-Human
Internal Revenue Service.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.380
Wh-Whatever has happened?!
Are you quite all right?!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.800
You startled him, that's all.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.970
Let me resurrect him!

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:20.850
I'm okay, I'm alive.

