00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.150
Allow me to re-introduce myself.

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:36.280
I am Nashim, a tax counselor with the
Non-Human Internal Revenue Service.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:41.910
I've come to speak with you
about unpaid income taxes.

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.660
O-Okay.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.250
As you no longer reside with your family,
you are not their dependent anymore.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.500
Thus, you must pay your own income taxes.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:55.750
DEPENDENT

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:52.750
If you possess property, then you must
pay a fixed asset tax on said property.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:55.750
FIXED 
ASSET 
TAX

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:56.340
If you've taken out
a home loan on that property...

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.750
HOME LOAN

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.510
I know what this is!

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.590
Some kind of magic spell!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:01.510
Taxes aren't magic, you're just stupid.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:05.100
When a member of a high-ranking
species becomes independent,

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.020
they must file a yearly income tax report,

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:11.230
but we have yet to receive yours.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.780
An income tax... report?

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.530
Do you not know anything?

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:21.450
Everyone pays a portion of their income
to the government. That's what taxes are.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:27.250
You need to tell the government how much
you earned to determine what you owe.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:31.580
I-I had no idea that dragons
have to pay taxes!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.630
Says the dragon looking to buy a house.

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:38.670
The Demon Lord is the reason we
non-humans can enjoy life in this society!

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:47.180
It is only under His protective wing
that we can live, nay, prosper! And taxes--

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.900
You, could it be?!

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:57.570
Oh, don't mind little old me.
Please, continue.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:00.200
Pretend I'm a cursed statue.

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.360
That would be even harder to ignore.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.370
Well, uh...

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:08.790
A traveling branch of the NHIRS'
tax office happens to be nearby.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:10.790
Would you like to file a report there?

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:15.920
Surely you wouldn't want to commit
tax evasion. That is a crime, after all.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.380
I'll go right now!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.750
"Don't forget to 
file your tax return!"

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.750
"Free consultations!"

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.880
Non-Human 
Internal 
Revenue 
Service

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.230
The filing window is right over here.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:36.270
I'll assist you with
your tax filing today.

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:40.860
First, please fill in the boxes
marked "required" on this form.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.950
We'll need your name,
species, and occupation.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:45.030
My occupation?

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.870
Oh! If your income is earned through
raiding villages or hunting heroes,

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.790
list yourself as "self-employed."

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:52.290
I'm unemployed.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.370
What is your address?

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:58.300
Uh, I'm actually looking for
somewhere to live right now.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.590
I see. That would make you...

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.260
Unemployed and unhoused.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.420
Unemployed and Unhoused

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:04.590
Yes, I'm sorry!

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:07.850
<i>And </i>he's fostering a child.
Quite the deadbeat, isn't he?

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.600
Give a guy a break, will ya?!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.640
DEADBEAT

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:13.560
N-Now, now, let's keep going.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.900
After leaving home, you've earned
zero income, is that correct?

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.900
Oh, I took on a few side jobs.

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:23.400
Wonderful! Then please
describe those in detail here.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:24.450
Okay.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:29.790
I'll just need to see your stat card
for a moment to finish this up.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.580
H-Here.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.830
Thank you very much.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.210
Wait just a moment
while I take care of things.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.420
I wanna see your card!

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.050
Nuh-uh!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.340
Come on, why not?!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.140
Because I say so!

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.510
Just a peek!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.220
No way, no how!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.640
Let's see here...

00:06:56.980 --> 00:07:00.690
How... How are you even a dragon?

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.190
How do you have such crappy stats?

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:06.070
You're preaching to the choir, Nell.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:11.740
It's horrifying to see how your pathetic
nature translates into numbers.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.460
What, you'd like to see it, too, Piyovelt?

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.330
You really shouldn't...

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:24.260
N-No, you see... it's just...

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:29.760
It's just <i>so </i>cool! Your father's
got quite the incredible stats!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.220
I'm in awe!

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.890
You handle this later!

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:36.230
What?! What am I supposed to do?!

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:38.270
Pip is too pure and innocent...

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:41.480
How could I break his heart like that?!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.320
Come back here!

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.110
So sorry about the wait.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:48.360
I had to dig around for
a particular set of documents...

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.820
Is everything all right?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.950
Yes, I'm fine.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.540
Now, Red Dragon,

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:57.830
as you're already here, I thought you
might want to take the opportunity

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.130
to apply for a child allowance.

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.670
What's that?

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:06.720
It's a small sum of money to assist
with any child-rearing expenses.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.510
You have two young children, do you not?

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.430
Wait, two?

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:11.970
Peek.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.100
Oh, no, the girl's not mine.

00:08:14.100 --> 00:08:17.100
She's a fine young lass.
I'll admit, I'm a bit jealous.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:22.520
She's wise, beautiful, and is quite
skilled at taking a human form.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.730
Wait, what?

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:30.160
I'll have you know I'm a flesh-and-blood
human, you insolent fool!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.370
She's human?!

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:34.160
Look, it's complicated...

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:37.580
I see, you're saving her
for later! Pardon me.

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:41.250
What?! No! I'm not going to eat her!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.000
That's the last of your forms.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:48.670
When you do find yourself a home,
come back to pay your property taxes!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.430
Right, property taxes...

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.560
Speaking of property taxes,

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:58.850
Letty, you should declare
that house you built.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:00.270
Oh! I totally forgot!

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.520
I'm glad you remembered!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.650
I gave it to someone else
right after building it, though.

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:07.320
I see, I see...

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:10.990
In that case, there will be
a capital gains deduction...

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:13.530
Capital... deduction?

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.620
I have all the necessary
contracts right here.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:20.960
Here is the total cost after property
and agency fees, then building expenses.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:38.590
PROPERTY FEE

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:27.500
BUILDING EXPENSE

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:38.590
AGENCY FEE

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.500
Might I see form for
the property transfer tax?

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:26.620
PROPERTY 

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.170
The property transfer tax was paid
before the sale contract was closed...

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:38.590
SALE CONTRACT

00:09:26.550 --> 00:09:27.170
H-Huh?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:31.800
PROPERTY 

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.340
Depreciation costs do not apply
as this is a private residence--

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:38.590
BUILDING EXPENSE

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:38.590
DEPRECIATION COSTS

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:34.550
Property acquisition tax does not apply
within range of the royal capital...

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:35.630
PROPERTY 

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:38.590
PROPERTY ACQUISITION TAX

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:38.520
Consumption tax would be paid
by the other party...

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:38.590
PROPERTY 

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:38.590
CONSUMPTION TAX

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.690
Here are the final numbers.
Would you like to look over it, Letty?

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:47.020
Oh, dear.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:50.030
Why don't we have him sign these later?

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:51.820
A fine idea.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.910
My goodness. I knew you
were feeble, but not to this extent.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.450
Papa!

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:01.790
Piyovelt, why don't we
help your father, here?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:09.960
"Acquisition" "Depreciation"
Acquisition... depreciation...

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.550
Letty? Letty, wake up.

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:15.930
Papa!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.010
Papa!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:20.520
Get up, you drummox!
Your documents are ready!

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:23.600
O-Oh, thanks.

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:26.860
Also, here!

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:29.150
Here's your next tour!

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:30.150
Huh?!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:36.490
I let Piyovelt choose, since leaving
it to you would take ages.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:39.280
And they say a picture's
worth a thousand words...

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:43.290
Thank you so much, Nell and Pip!

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:46.380
You're a dragon. I can't believe you're
crying over something like this.

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:49.550
This is the first and only time
we're deciding for you!

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:51.630
You pick the next one, got it?!

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:52.460
Got it!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:55.880
I feel good about this one!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:59.100
Let's go! Soon, I won't have to
check the box next to "unhoused"!

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:00.430
Yeah!

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:06.310
Where is this property
we're touring, anyway?

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:09.020
It's in the royal capital's
old sewer system.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:12.440
I wasn't aware that non-humans
had their own royal capital.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.990
We don't.

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:16.570
This property is in
the human royal capital,

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.660
very close to your old home, Nell.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.790
Wha...

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:25.540
What?!

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:47.940
We're actually here...

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.560
...in the human city...

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.110
Well, underneath it, but yes.

00:11:56.490 --> 00:12:01.740
If my retainers knew that their princess
was wandering through their sewers...

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:06.080
No one would suspect their princess
and a dragon was right beneath their feet.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.080
You needn't worry
about anyone finding out.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.580
I can't help it!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.920
I can't believe we actually came here!

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:16.420
I thought you'd pick up on my
apprehension and suggest elsewhere!

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:18.840
W-Well, Dearia was all like...

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:23.010
Shall we head out immediately,
or take a quick rest first?

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.220
We didn't even get a choice.

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.230
We got railroaded!

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:30.810
Why would a dragon even
want to live here, anyway?

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.230
Here we are.

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:37.860
W-Wow, there's actually
a place to live down here!

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:41.030
The property is a few hundred years old,

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:44.830
but it's dwarven-built,
so you needn't worry about its age.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.660
Hold on!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.370
I know this place!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.830
Huh?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.880
This is my kingdom's man-made dungeon,

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:55.550
built for training Heroes!

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:57.340
You trained them?!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:12:58.170
Yes, that's correct.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.840
C'mon, Dearia!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.430
Most human-non-human interactions
occur in dungeons, yes?

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:09.440
True, and there are monsters living
here for heroes to train against.

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:12.860
A lot of us do live in dungeons...

00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:14.650
I understand the situation now.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.900
You do?

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:25.120
The kingdom commissioned dwarves
to build this dungeon to train Heroes.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:25.200
Founder

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:25.200
Felix

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:25.200
II

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.660
The employees staffing the dungeon would
play the part of the dungeon's enemies,

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:34.710
requiring the hire of numerous
non-humans to work as live-in employees.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:37.050
Which means, if you'd like to live here,

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:40.220
you would need to
become a public servant.

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:40.090
Public Servant

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:46.090
Public Servant

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.930
You would need to pass an interview,

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:46.560
but your being a dragon would make it
quite easy to get the job here, Letty.

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:49.980
I had no idea...

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.890
Why not live here then? It's quite nice.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.270
I-I don't know, I don't like fighting...

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:57.690
But this is your chance to gain both
a home and a job all at once!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:58.820
I dunno...

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:02.700
For now, let us take
a look at the property.

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:06.200
What if we run into some Heroes, though?

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.910
Not to worry.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.160
The training grounds are closed today.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:13.240
Closed Today

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:13.620
Wow. It really is a government office.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.750
Leave the dungeon crawling to me!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.630
I've always wanted to explore a dungeon!

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:22.590
To tour it, not beat it, right?

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:24.130
Let's go!

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:27.850
She sure is raring to go...

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:29.560
Wait, Pip, too?!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.940
Whoa, it's bigger than I expected.

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:34.900
Stop dawdling!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.560
Let's explore the side paths first.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.280
What? Why?

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:44.450
Everyone knows there are never any
treasure boxes or items on the main path.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.860
Are you still half-asleep?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.200
I certainly didn't know.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.580
Did your parent's house
not have any treasure chests?!

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:53.960
Well, no. Just think about it.

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:57.290
Why would anyone leave a chest
full of valuables in a hallway?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:00.050
Oh, you're right, that does seem silly.

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:02.460
Then you didn't have any mimics, either?!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:05.050
Why would I want something
scary like that in my house?!

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:08.350
What about barrels or boxes that
give you items when you break them?!

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:10.720
We put our items in drawers
like we're supposed to!

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.020
No...

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:16.440
Is everything I know
about dungeons... wrong?!

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:20.230
Monster lairs are filled with
items and treasure chests!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.740
But watch out for mimics!

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:28.620
These dungeons you speak of are the
creations of human imagination and bias.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.990
Oh, so this place...

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:34.460
...is what humans <i>think </i>dungeons
are supposed to be like?

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:35.910
Well put.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:40.790
No need to feel so down, Nell.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:44.050
You can hire a mimic
for your house if you like.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:45.590
Can you start tomorrow?

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.340
I'm down!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.420
"Thanks, Mimic with
Flexible Availability!"

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:53.600
The terrible greed of Heroes has created
great demand for theft prevention.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.020
Take a look at this catalog.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:57.390
My goodness!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:00.560
When you find a house, I'll get
you one as a housewarming gift.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.780
No, thanks!

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:07.150
Let's continue with our tour. Next, let's
head for the employee living quarters.

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.950
Dungeon crawling time!

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.820
Y-Yay.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.330
NELL

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.330
Princess

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.330
LETTY

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.330
Loser

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.330
PIYOVELT

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.330
Mascot

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.330
DEARIA

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.330
Dark Lord

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.290
What's this weird music?

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:17.710
The dungeon music.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.330
A monster appeared!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.250
The music changed!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:30.090
Gargoyle in PJs Drinking a Smoothie

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:32.180
Wh-What do we do, Letty?!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:35.090
What should I do?

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:35.090
Fight

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:35.090
Defend

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:35.090
Run

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:35.090
Do Nothing

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:35.020
Um, uh...

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.940
Sorry to bother you on your day off.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.100
What should I do?

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.100
Fight

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.100
Defend

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.100
Run

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:40.100
Do Nothing

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:40.020
You're good.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.490
Is this a swamp?

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:51.990
A poison swamp!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:56.870
Is this the boss room?!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:12.340
What the heck?!

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.420
You are in Rock

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:15.390
We haven't made any progress...

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:19.440
Who went through the trouble
of making the dungeon this big?!

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:21.560
Your ancestors, apparently...

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.690
Good efforts, both of you.

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:28.440
Hey, Dearia, could you
give us a little hint?

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:29.530
Please?

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:31.240
C'mon!

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:34.990
Just keep going straight...

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.490
Did you say something?

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.950
No.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.500
B-But I just heard someone murmuring
in my ear to "go straight"!

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.670
Was it a ghost?

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:45.500
Th-That joke is hardly funny!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:49.590
You likely are hearing a "whispered hint."

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:58.100
It's dungeon magic that assists lost Hero
trainees to put them on the right path.

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:58.100
Don't worry. Keep going, and you'll find
a door with a save point behind it.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:59.560
Wow.

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:02.600
Though it is not always helpful.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.980
I'd kill for some KFC.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:06.320
You're right.

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:09.230
At least now we know
we're going the right way!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:13.240
Sheesh, it could have told us earlier!

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.870
What time is it?

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.120
Did I turn off the stove?

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.200
Did I lock the door?

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.660
Did I bring in the laundry?

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.660
Is it going to rain today?

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.540
Did I put yesterday's
leftovers in the fridge?

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:28.170
Stop, you're giving me anxiety!

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:33.180
We've walked a long way now...

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:36.760
Look, Letty!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:39.310
A big door!

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:43.230
Past this door is the boss arena.

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:46.190
The employee living quarters
are just past it.

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.610
We made it!

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:50.440
Let's get going, then!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:55.820
What are you doing?

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:59.080
That door won't open until you have all
the necessary pieces of the stone relief.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.450
What?!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.960
But it took us forever to get here!

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:07.500
Huh? I feel like I've
seen this somewhere...

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:14.430
Great eye! This dungeon was crafted
by the same artisan as the Temple of Fall.

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.760
I'm impressed, Letty.

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:19.350
I dunno if I'm impressed.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.100
I'm going to find every last one of them!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.770
Wait, Nell!

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.810
It's dangerous to go alone!

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:27.640
Found something.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.440
Wait, already?!

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:32.070
Not the statues, but...

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.150
One part of the relief this way.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.150
Where the dink are
the other pieces, asshole?!

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.860
The Hero trainees' graffiti.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.120
They had it tough, too...

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.750
Is this what we're looking for?

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:46.500
Judging from how obvious
they're making it, I'd assume so.

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:49.080
Grab it so we can head for the next one!

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.460
On it!

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:55.010
What's that sound?

00:19:58.010 --> 00:20:00.970
The ceiling's coming down on us!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.350
The stone! Put it back!

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:05.230
H-Hold on!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:08.190
I put it in my satchel 'cause I didn't
think we'd need it again right away!

00:20:08.190 --> 00:20:11.320
Nope, nope, where is it...

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:14.150
The path's getting closed off!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:17.780
You took the statue? Find something that
weighs the same or you're a goner!

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:19.410
See ya in heaven, losers!

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:22.910
You little bastard! Way to rub it in!

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:26.460
Stop dawdling, drummox!

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:30.460
S-Sorry, I'm trying
to find it, but I can't!

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:32.130
Give it to me, moron!

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:35.170
Pip!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:43.390
A hidden door! Well done, Piyovelt!

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.850
Hurry, Letty!

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:52.190
My legs! My tail!

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:02.030
We made it...

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:05.790
Here I thought I was
gonna be a dragon pancake.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:05.860
"Our Dungeon Specialty!"

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:08.540
What's up ahead?

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:12.210
Where do you think it leads?

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:16.130
Can we go this way to get back to Dearia?

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:19.720
I don't know. We'll just have to find out.

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:26.560
Look up and I'll gouge out your eyes.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:28.350
I won't, sheesh!

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:34.400
A dead end...

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:37.570
But I think it will open with a push...

00:21:37.570 --> 00:21:39.860
Could you let me try?

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:42.780
Up we go.

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:50.580
Oh, wow!

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:52.540
It's so shiny!

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:57.420
Oh, no.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.760
Nell?

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:01.220
This isn't good.

00:22:01.220 --> 00:22:02.430
This...

00:22:02.430 --> 00:22:07.220
...is the royal palace!

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:07.220
Wait, we're in your house?!

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:38.430
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:38.480
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:38.520
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:40.110
Welcome.

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:41.360
If you're in search of property,

00:23:41.360 --> 00:23:45.280
why not come by one of Elf Housing
Realty's local real estate shows?

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:47.280
Next time, "A Well-Defended Home."

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:47.650
To be continued

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:47.690
To be continued

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:48.400
To be continued
